---
description: Review Cleanora changes against active scope with file-line evidence.
globs: "{src/**/*.ts,prisma/**,specs/**/*.md}"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Read `CLAUDE.md`, active artifacts, and the complete diff.
- Prioritize correctness, ownership, authorization, data safety, migration risk, and missing tests.
- Report exact file and line evidence, impact, violated rule, and focused remediation.
- Separate blocker/major findings from minors and questions.
- Verify claims where safe; list checks not run.
- Do not request broad rewrites when a focused repair is sufficient.
- Use `docs/ai/templates/review-report.md`.
